13" value="Undo, dry run, proposal and parameter sweep&lt;br&gt;are all: build another document value&lt;br&gt;and reuse the per-node cache." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF9DB;strokeColor=#E9D58A;fontColor=#1B1F24;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="85" width="280" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
